I built "The tagging desk" for turn-enricher, the asset that takes over station `cataloguer` (replaces Cataloguer). It is an unmanned purple Memory-zone desk with these parts:
- an in-tray and a slanted lectern with a reading lamp;
- a red/green signal gauge with a tick at the 0.5 threshold, whose lamp lights while the desk calls Jev;
- a lavender facts board with action, artifact and blocker tabs
